    "title": "Literacy path — Wave 15",
    "description": "Fifteenth production literacy slice: kasra+sukun transfer onto jim, first kasra-onset closed chunk جِسْ, then decode jism. Compact two-unit wave. No new phonics rule, no new consonant, no damma, madd-yaa, madd-waw, hamza, sentences, or Wave 16.",
